                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 space-y-2">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 block">Esquema de Pago:</span>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold">
                            <div class="p-2 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
                                <strong>60 %</strong><br><span class="text-[10px] font-normal">Inicio del Proyecto</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-2 bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 rounded-lg border border-slate-300">
                                <strong>40 %</strong><br><span class="text-[10px] font-normal">Contra Finalización</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 italic p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
                        Los valores expresados en dólares podrán abonarse en dicha moneda o en pesos argentinos al tipo de cambio pactado para la operación.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 9: CONSIDERACIONES TÉCNICAS -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
            <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-3">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-amber-500"></i>
                    9. Consideraciones Técnicas de Ingeniería
                </h3>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                La producción y el ahorro indicados corresponden a una estimación preliminar de ingeniería. El resultado económico real dependerá principalmente de:
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-700">
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clock text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Perfil horario de consumo.
                </div>
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-sun text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Consumo en horas solares.
                </div>
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Estacionalidad verano/invierno.
                </div>
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-compass text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Orientación e inclinación.
                </div>
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-sun text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Sombras y clima real.
                </div>
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Evolución tarifaria EDESE S.A.
                </div>
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Marcos tarifarios y tributarios.
                </div>
                <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check text-amber-500 mb-1 block"></i>
                    Validación previa en obra.
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 10 & CONCLUSION FOOTER -->
        <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 text-center print-shadow-none">
            <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-4">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg">
                    <svg class="w-12 h-12" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <rect x="75" y="55" width="50" height="50" rx="8" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="4.5" fill="none"/>
                        <rect x="85" y="65" width="30" height="30" rx="5" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none"/>
                        <rect x="92" y="72" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="#F59E0B"/>
                        <line x1="83" y1="47" x2="83" y2="55" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <line x1="94" y1="47" x2="94" y2="55" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <line x1="106" y1="47" x2="106" y2="55" stroke="#F59E0B" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
